{"id":2306,"date":"2024-09-19T12:34:11","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:34:11","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2306"},"modified":"2025-10-02T14:18:17","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T14:18:17","slug":"cardboard-snack-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-snack-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Cardboard Snack Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Packaging Solutions for Chips, Baked Items, and Treats<\/h2>\n<p>Packaging snacks the right way can improve freshness, presentation, and customer satisfaction. At <em>Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/em>, we provide <strong>custom cardboard snack boxes<\/strong> designed to match your branding and food safety needs. Whether you&#8217;re packing chips, trail mixes, baked items, or treats, we offer packaging that performs in every setting.<\/p>\n<p>With <strong>cardboard snack boxes wholesale<\/strong>, you get quality packaging at a better price point. Our boxes are made from food-grade, durable materials and are available in multiple sizes, finishes, and styles. You can also order <strong>cardboard snack boxes for sale<\/strong> in bulk quantities with fast turnaround times and free shipping.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Strong and Reliable Cardboard Snack Boxes<\/h2>\n<h3>Designed to Hold and Protect All Types of Snacks<\/h3>\n<p>Snack packaging must be reliable and presentable. That\u2019s why we focus on building strong boxes that suit your product type and business model.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ideal for dry foods, bars, and bakery items<\/li>\n<li>Lightweight and easy to stack<\/li>\n<li>Custom inserts and dividers available<\/li>\n<li>Can be sealed with flaps or lids<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Whether you&#8217;re a food startup, caf\u00e9, or large-scale snack producer, we offer <strong>large cardboard snack boxes<\/strong> and compact sizes to suit all use cases.<\/p>\n<h3>Food-Safe and Sustainable Materials<\/h3>\n<p>Our materials are safe for direct or indirect food contact. We offer boxes made from:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Corrugated cardboard for shipping<\/li>\n<li>Kraft paper for a natural look<\/li>\n<li>White SBS board for retail display<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>For food-related uses, our snack packaging also complements many other options available under our <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-food-packaging\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"350\" data-end=\"446\"><strong data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"379\">Cardboard Food Packaging<\/strong><\/a> line. These are designed for bakeries, cafes, and meal prep services needing safe, clean, and brandable packaging formats for various food items.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Cardboard Snack Boxes with Lids and Custom Options<\/h2>\n<h3>Easy to Open, Seal, and Store<\/h3>\n<p>If you need packaging that keeps snacks secure and tidy, our <strong>cardboard snack boxes with lids<\/strong> are a smart choice. The lids protect against dust, moisture, and handling damage.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tuck-in or flip-top lids for retail or delivery<\/li>\n<li>Reinforced edges to maintain shape<\/li>\n<li>Die-cut handles or openings available<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>These lid-style boxes are also perfect for ready-to-eat snack boxes, vending use, and on-the-go food counters.<\/p>\n<h3>Sizes and Shapes Made to Order<\/h3>\n<p>We provide all custom sizes based on your snack type and packaging preference. Popular requests include:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Single-serve snack boxes<\/li>\n<li>Multi-slot boxes for snack kits<\/li>\n<li>Large snack hampers for corporate gifting<\/li>\n<li>Foldable boxes for easy storage and stacking<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<table class=\"border-borderMain dark:border-borderMainDark my-[1em] w-full table-auto border\">\n<thead class=\"bg-offset dark:bg-offsetDark\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Specification<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Dimensions<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Fully custom sizes for single-serve, multi-slot, hampers, or foldable snack boxes<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Corrugated E-flute, Kraft, White SBS, Food-Grade Cardstock<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Custom inserts, dividers, window cutouts, handles<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Snack packaging, retail display, gifting, takeout<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Printing<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">CMYK, PMS, Foil, Embossing, Inside &amp; Outside Printing<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">14pt to 24pt thickness<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Offset or Digital<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">High-res logos, QR codes, barcodes, branding elements<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Branding, promotional packaging, retail shelves<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>\u00a0Box Styles<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Mailer, Tuck End, Sleeve, Gable, Two-Piece<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Matches box material<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Smooth or textured finishes<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Die-cut shapes, thumb notches, slits<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Snack kits, bakery items, food hampers<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>\u00a0Lid Types<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Full cover, half cover, hinged, removable, tuck-in, or flip-top lids<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Customizable with all materials<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Gloss, Matte, or Spot UV<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Reinforced edges, dust\/moisture protection<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Ready-to-eat, vending, on-the-go counters<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>\u00a0Quantities<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">100 \u2013 500,000 units<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">All materials available<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">All finishes available<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Bulk pricing, fast turnaround<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Events, retail, bulk shipping<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Design Proof\u00a0<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">3D mock-up, flat view, physical sample (available upon request)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Applies to all options<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Applies to all finishes<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Free design support, expert guidance<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Preview before production, design approval<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>\u00a0 Shipping<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Free nationwide shipping, flat-packed or pre-assembled options<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Applies to all orders<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Applies to all finishes<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Space-saving, ready-to-use<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">eCommerce, retail, food delivery<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Why Choose Cardboard Snack Boxes Wholesale<\/h2>\n<h3>Affordable Bulk Pricing<\/h3>\n<p>With <strong>cardboard snack boxes wholesale<\/strong>, you reduce costs and improve packaging consistency. Whether you&#8217;re prepping for events or fulfilling retail shelf orders, bulk packaging makes operations easier.<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>Lower unit costs<\/li>\n<li>Quick access to packaging stock<\/li>\n<li>Consistent branding in every box<\/li>\n<li>Time-saving reordering process<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>We support small runs as well as large-scale orders to suit your business cycle.<\/p>\n<h3>Suitable for Many Industries<\/h3>\n<p>Our snack boxes are widely used across different sectors:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Food delivery and takeout services<\/li>\n<li>Gift box sellers<\/li>\n<li>Snack subscription brands<\/li>\n<li>Grocery and convenience retailers<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>To explore more product types designed specifically for food applications, visit our full collection of <a class=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/food-related-cardboard-boxes\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1144\"><strong data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1064\">Food-Related Cardboard Boxes<\/strong><\/a>. This category includes pizza boxes, bakery packaging, and other food-safe options.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Coating and Finish Options for Retail Appeal<\/h2>\n<h3>Stand Out on the Shelf or Online<\/h3>\n<p>Presentation matters when it comes to snack packaging. We offer premium finishes to make your boxes more eye-catching.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Gloss coating<\/strong> for shine and color vibrancy<\/li>\n<li><strong>Matte finish<\/strong> for a soft and clean look<\/li>\n<li><strong>Spot UV<\/strong> to highlight brand names or graphics<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>You can also add windows, cutouts, or printed inserts to showcase the snack variety inside the box.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Easy Ordering with Free Support<\/h2>\n<h3>Steps to Order Your Snack Boxes<\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Choose your size, style, and quantity<\/li>\n<li>Submit your artwork or request design help<\/li>\n<li>Review your free 3D or flat proof<\/li>\n<li>Approve and place your order<\/li>\n<li>Receive your custom boxes with free delivery<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>Our team is available to guide you at each step, from material selection to final printing.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Why Shop Cardboard Boxes is a Reliable Choice<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Wholesale pricing on all orders<\/li>\n<li>Custom sizes and design support included<\/li>\n<li>Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV finish options<\/li>\n<li>Fast production turnaround<\/li>\n<li>Free mock-ups and layout proofs<\/li>\n<li>High-quality printing on food-safe materials<\/li>\n<li>Free nationwide shipping on every order<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p><a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><strong>Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/strong><\/a> for high-quality Cardboard Snack Boxes at wholesale prices. Our boxes are made from durable, recyclable materials and are available in a variety of sizes and styles. We also offer fast turnaround times and free design and shipping. With quick turnaround times and top-notch customer service, you\u2019ll have the perfect packaging solution in no time. Order now to get started!<\/p>\n<div class=\"container\"><\/div>\n<div class=\"container\"><\/div>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2434,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[183],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2306","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-food-related-cardboard-boxes","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Order Custom Cardboard Snack Boxes , Wholesale Packaging<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Bulk cardboard snack boxes for businesses. Ideal for food packaging, takeout, and retail displays. Wholesale pricing available.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-snack-boxes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Order Custom Cardboard Snack Boxes , Wholesale Packaging\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Bulk cardboard snack boxes for businesses. Ideal for food packaging, takeout, and retail displays. Wholesale pricing available.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-snack-boxes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Shop Cardboard Boxes\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-10-02T14:18:17+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/Cardboard-Snack-Bo